{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"capabilities":{"experimental":{},"prompts":{"listChanged":false},"resources":{"listChanged":false,"subscribe":false},"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"instructions":"代码仓库工具集。所有路径都相对于仓库根 E:\\aicoding\\mini-claude-code\\fixtures\\mini_repo，越出该目录的访问一律被拒绝。典型用法：先 search_code 定位，再 read_file 看清上下文，然后 apply_patch 修改，最后 run_tests 验证。","protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","serverInfo":{"name":"code-tools","version":"1.0.0"}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"tools":[{"description":"列出仓库内某目录下的条目（相对仓库根的路径）。\n\n    subdir: 相对仓库根的目录，默认 \".\"（仓库根）\n    pattern: 通配符，默认 \"*\"；例如 \"*.py\"、\"test_*.py\"\n    ","inputSchema":{"properties":{"subdir":{"default":".","title":"Subdir","type":"string"},"pattern":{"default":"*","title":"Pattern","type":"string"}},"type":"object","title":"list_filesArguments"},"name":"list_files","outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"title":"Result","type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","title":"list_filesOutput"}},{"description":"按正则搜索仓库内文件内容，返回 `相对路径:行号: 内容`。\n\n    regex: Python 正则\n    glob:  只搜匹配该通配符的文件，默认 \"*.py\"\n    subdir: 搜索起点，默认仓库根\n    ","inputSchema":{"properties":{"regex":{"title":"Regex","type":"string"},"glob":{"default":"*.py","title":"Glob","type":"string"},"subdir":{"default":".","title":"Subdir","type":"string"}},"required":["regex"],"type":"object","title":"search_codeArguments"},"name":"search_code","outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"title":"Result","type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","title":"search_codeOutput"}},{"description":"读仓库内的文本文件，输出带行号（便于回填给 apply_patch）。\n\n    path:  相对仓库根的路径\n    start: 起始行（1 起算；0 表示从头）\n    end:   结束行（含；0 表示到末尾）\n    ","inputSchema":{"properties":{"path":{"title":"Path","type":"string"},"start":{"default":0,"title":"Start","type":"integer"},"end":{"default":0,"title":"End","type":"integer"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object","title":"read_fileArguments"},"name":"read_file","outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"title":"Result","type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","title":"read_fileOutput"}},{"description":"把文件里的 old 精确替换成 new。\n\n    ⚠️ old 必须在文件中**唯一出现**，否则拒绝 —— 歧义匹配会改错地方，\n       而\"改错地方\"比\"没改\"更难排查。需要时请给出更长的上下文片段。\n    ","inputSchema":{"properties":{"path":{"title":"Path","type":"string"},"old":{"title":"Old","type":"string"},"new":{"title":"New","type":"string"}},"required":["path","old","new"],"type":"object","title":"apply_patchArguments"},"name":"apply_patch","outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"title":"Result","type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","title":"apply_patchOutput"}},{"description":"给出仓库的**结构索引**：文件清单 + 每个文件里的类 / 函数 / 常量 + 行号。\n\n    用途：**一次**拿到全局轮廓。拿到行号后，用\n    `read_file(path, start=行号, end=行号+N)` 只读需要的区间，\n    而不是把整个文件读进来。\n\n    比 list_files 多的是符号与行号；比逐个 read_file 省的是正文。\n    ","inputSchema":{"properties":{"subdir":{"default":".","title":"Subdir","type":"string"},"pattern":{"default":"*.py","title":"Pattern","type":"string"}},"type":"object","title":"repo_mapArguments"},"name":"repo_map","outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"title":"Result","type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","title":"repo_mapOutput"}},{"description":"在仓库根运行 pytest，返回真实退出码与输出。\n\n    test_path: 可选的测试文件/目录（相对仓库根，必须在仓库内）\n    keyword:   可选的 pytest -k 表达式（只允许字母数字与 _ - . 空格）\n    detail:    \"brief\"（默认，每个失败只给一行）或 \"full\"（完整堆栈）\n\n    ⚠️ 本工具**不接收命令字符串** —— 命令由服务端拼装，agent 只给受校验的参数。\n       这是「权限与沙箱」层的核心设计：不给入口，比过滤参数可靠。\n    ","inputSchema":{"properties":{"test_path":{"default":"","title":"Test Path","type":"string"},"keyword":{"default":"","title":"Keyword","type":"string"},"detail":{"default":"brief","title":"Detail","type":"string"}},"type":"object","title":"run_testsArguments"},"name":"run_tests","outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"title":"Result","type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","title":"run_testsOutput"}}]}}
